			</a>)</dd></dl><dl><dt>Covers requirements
					:
				</dt><dd>- What is before what?,What's next?,What's immediately following this?</dd><dd>- What things are contained in this collection (community, collective)? What collections this thing is member of?</dd><dd>- What are the items (elements) in this list?</dd><dd>- What are the items contained in this bag? </dd><dd>- What bag is this item an element of?</dd><dd>- What is the first/last item in this list?</dd><dd>- What is the length (size) of this list?</dd><dd>- What is the size of this bag?</dd><dd>- What it the next/previous item in the list?</dd><dd>- What resource does this item refer to?</dd><dd>- What resource does this list item contain?</dd></dl><dl><dt>Has component
